_pdbx_entry_details.compound_details           
;ALPHA3 BETA3 SUBCOMPLEX OF F1-ATPASE COMPRISES THREE ALPHA
AND THREE BETA SUBUNITS.  BECAUSE THE SUBCOMPLEX IS
SYMMETRICAL, ONE ALPHA (CHAIN B) AND ONE BETA (CHAIN E)
SUBUNITS ARE GIVEN.  THE ENTIRE SUBCOMPLEX CAN BE FORMED
USING THE TRANSFORMATIONS GIVEN IN REMARK 350.
;
